ns and jog to\nthe end. 15 alligator merkins and jog to the middle.\nWalking lunges (5, 10, 15) along with incline merkins (5, 10, 15), 5 burpees. \nFor those finish early, do 15 of imperial walkers. Everyone do imperial walkers together for\n30 seconds.\nRun to the Holiday Inn hotel –\nSideway bear crawl on the stairs, walk back down and repeat with using the other side of the body. Let’s do this for four times. Two\non each side.\nThen jog back to the starting point,","id":"13ee4a44-085a-45f9-b3e3-90a5364351d0","title":"Thang 1"}],"thangs":"Thang 1\nSit down Touch toes 30 secs\nAmerican hammers 45 secs\nLittle Baby Flutter Crunches (On your 6, feet do flutter kick while upper body does crunch.\nIgnore number of times your legs move, only count crunches) 30 secs\nSquats 30 secs\nJog to the dock: 5 Alligator merkins and jog to the end, then 10 alligator merkins and jog to\nthe end. 15 alligator merkins and jog to the middle.\nWalking lunges (5, 10, 15) along with incline merkins (5, 10, 15), 5 burpees. \nFor those finish early, do 15 of imperial walkers. Everyone do imperial walkers together for\n30 seconds.\nRun to the Holiday Inn hotel –\nSideway bear crawl on the stairs, walk back down and repeat with using the other side of the body. Let’s do this for four times. Two\non each side.\nThen jog back to the starting point,","thirdFLegacyText":"","thirdFMode":"auto","thirdFText":"","timers":[],"title":"Fobulous Q","warmorama":"Little arm circles forward (10) little arm circles backward (10), in cadence"}}],"protectedSessionsSha256":"42e16fe7d1038f02fb484964d63c7d0b42f8b27bdf53a25c843825e38ec3fc35","region":{"activated_at":null,"activated_by_user_id":null,"created_at":"2026-09-28T14:38:38.977421+00:00","environment":"production","fng_naming_post_number":1,"id":"45a32e90-3f95-5261-bb49-5719f6f77cca","include_in_reporting":false,"lifecycle_status":"onboarding","lifecycle_updated_at":"2026-09-28T15:31:08.501454+00:00","lifecycle_updated_by_user_id":null,"name":"F3 SacTow